</div>
<p>Ever imagined walking through green fields, picking juicy strawberries in the sun? The <strong>Nuwara Eliya strawberry farms and picking experiences</strong> let you do just that. You&#8217;ll get to enjoy nature and taste fresh strawberries. Nuwara Eliya is known for its stunning views and perfect weather for strawberries.</p>
<p>This article will show you the amazing strawberry picking in Nuwara Eliya. You&#8217;ll learn about the <strong>best strawberry farms in Nuwara Eliya</strong>. And what to expect when you visit.</p>
<h2>Introduction to Nuwara Eliya Strawberry Farms</h2>
<p>Nuwara Eliya is known as &#8220;Little England&#8221; for its unique climate and fertile soil. It&#8217;s perfect for growing strawberries. Visitors can enjoy the <em>Nuwara Eliya strawberry farms and picking experiences</em> for a memorable day outdoors. The farms are just 10 kilometers from the bus stand, along the beautiful Hakgala &#8211; Ambewela Road.</p>
<p>Here, you can pick your own strawberries right from the plant. It&#8217;s a fun activity for all ages. You&#8217;ll make lasting memories.</p>
<p>The farms also offer a variety of tasty products. You can buy fresh strawberries, homemade jams, and juices. These items are great for taking a piece of Nuwara Eliya home. This is why Nuwara Eliya is famous for its <em>best strawberry farms</em>, drawing both locals and tourists.</p>
<p>Harvesting your own strawberries is a joy. You&#8217;ll also love the beautiful surroundings. It&#8217;s a special adventure for friends and family.</p>
<p><img decoding="async" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20696%20398'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="Nuwara Eliya strawberry farms and picking experiences" title="Nuwara Eliya strawberry farms and picking experiences" width="696" height="398" class="aligncenter size-large wp-image-171527" data-lazy-srcset="https://tripjive.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Nuwara-Eliya-strawberry-farms-and-picking-experiences-1-1024x585.jpg 1024w, https://tripjive.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Nuwara-Eliya-strawberry-farms-and-picking-experiences-1-300x171.jpg 300w, https://tripjive.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Nuwara-Eliya-strawberry-farms-and-picking-experiences-1-768x439.jpg 768w, https://tripjive.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Nuwara-Eliya-strawberry-farms-and-picking-experiences-1.jpg 1344w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 696px) 100vw, 696px" data-lazy-src="https://tripjive.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Nuwara-Eliya-strawberry-farms-and-picking-experiences-1-1024x585.jpg" /><noscript><img decoding="async" src="https://tripjive.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Nuwara-Eliya-strawberry-farms-and-picking-experiences-1-1024x585.jpg" alt="Nuwara Eliya strawberry farms and picking experiences" title="Nuwara Eliya strawberry farms and picking experiences" width="696" height="398" class="aligncenter size-large wp-image-171527" srcset="https://tripjive.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Nuwara-Eliya-strawberry-farms-and-picking-experiences-1-1024x585.jpg 1024w, https://tripjive.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Nuwara-Eliya-strawberry-farms-and-picking-experiences-1-300x171.jpg 300w, https://tripjive.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Nuwara-Eliya-strawberry-farms-and-picking-experiences-1-768x439.jpg 768w, https://tripjive.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Nuwara-Eliya-strawberry-farms-and-picking-experiences-1.jpg 1344w" sizes="(max-width: 696px) 100vw, 696px" /></noscript></p>
<h2>The Allure of Strawberry Picking in Nuwara Eliya</h2>
<p>Strawberry picking in Nuwara Eliya is a sweet escape into nature. From September to April, farms are alive with activity. Visitors love the excitement of picking ripe strawberries.</p>
<p>Walking through lush fields, you can pick juicy berries right from the plant. The stunning misty mountains and greenery make every moment special. It&#8217;s perfect for both amateur and professional photographers.</p>
<p>Surrounded by fresh air and calm landscapes, your time is filled with joy. It&#8217;s a chance to make lasting memories with loved ones. The peaceful setting turns a simple activity into a memorable adventure.</p>
<p><img decoding="async" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20696%20398'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="strawberry picking Nuwara Eliya" title="strawberry picking Nuwara Eliya" width="696" height="398" class="aligncenter size-large wp-image-171528" data-lazy-srcset="https://tripjive.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/strawberry-picking-Nuwara-Eliya-1024x585.jpg 1024w, https://tripjive.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/strawberry-picking-Nuwara-Eliya-300x171.jpg 300w, https://tripjive.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/strawberry-picking-Nuwara-Eliya-768x439.jpg 768w, https://tripjive.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/strawberry-picking-Nuwara-Eliya.jpg 1344w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 696px) 100vw, 696px" data-lazy-src="https://tripjive.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/strawberry-picking-Nuwara-Eliya-1024x585.jpg" /><noscript><img decoding="async" src="https://tripjive.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/strawberry-picking-Nuwara-Eliya-1024x585.jpg" alt="strawberry picking Nuwara Eliya" title="strawberry picking Nuwara Eliya" width="696" height="398" class="aligncenter size-large wp-image-171528" srcset="https://tripjive.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/strawberry-picking-Nuwara-Eliya-1024x585.jpg 1024w, https://tripjive.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/strawberry-picking-Nuwara-Eliya-300x171.jpg 300w, https://tripjive.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/strawberry-picking-Nuwara-Eliya-768x439.jpg 768w, https://tripjive.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/strawberry-picking-Nuwara-Eliya.jpg 1344w" sizes="(max-width: 696px) 100vw, 696px" /></noscript></p>
<p>Are you ready for this delightful experience? Strawberry picking in Nuwara Eliya offers more than just fruit. It&#8217;s a chance to connect with nature and make special memories. Explore the fields, enjoy delicious strawberries, and discover the rich flavors of this place.</p>
<h2>Nuwara Eliya Strawberry Farms and Picking Experiences</h2>
<p>The <b>Nuwara Eliya strawberry picking season</b> is a wonderful time to connect with nature. It&#8217;s also a great chance to enjoy fresh strawberries. You can pick strawberries from September to April, giving you plenty of time to have fun.</p>
<p>The best times to visit are in the morning or late afternoon. This helps you avoid the hot sun and makes picking strawberries more enjoyable.</p>
<h3>Best Time to Visit for Strawberry Picking</h3>
<p>During the strawberry picking season, the farms are full of ripe strawberries. If you&#8217;re wondering <em>where to pick strawberries in Nuwara Eliya</em>, visiting between these months is best. The atmosphere is lively, and the scenery is beautiful, making it a perfect day out.</p>
<h3>What to Expect During Your Visit</h3>
<p>At the Nuwara Eliya strawberry farms, you&#8217;ll meet friendly staff ready to help. Most farms give you baskets to carry your strawberries. You can also take a tractor tour to see the fields and enjoy the views.</p>
<p>Some farms have shops where you can buy special strawberry products. These are great to go with your fresh strawberries.</p>
<p><img decoding="async" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20696%20398'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="Nuwara Eliya strawberry picking season" title="Nuwara Eliya strawberry picking season" width="696" height="398" class="aligncenter size-large wp-image-171529" data-lazy-srcset="https://tripjive.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Nuwara-Eliya-strawberry-picking-season-1024x585.jpg 1024w, https://tripjive.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Nuwara-Eliya-strawberry-picking-season-300x171.jpg 300w, https://tripjive.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Nuwara-Eliya-strawberry-picking-season-768x439.jpg 768w, https://tripjive.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Nuwara-Eliya-strawberry-picking-season.jpg 1344w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 696px) 100vw, 696px" data-lazy-src="https://tripjive.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Nuwara-Eliya-strawberry-picking-season-1024x585.jpg" /><noscript><img decoding="async" src="https://tripjive.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Nuwara-Eliya-strawberry-picking-season-1024x585.jpg" alt="Nuwara Eliya strawberry picking season" title="Nuwara Eliya strawberry picking season" width="696" height="398" class="aligncenter size-large wp-image-171529" srcset="https://tripjive.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Nuwara-Eliya-strawberry-picking-season-1024x585.jpg 1024w, https://tripjive.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Nuwara-Eliya-strawberry-picking-season-300x171.jpg 300w, https://tripjive.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Nuwara-Eliya-strawberry-picking-season-768x439.jpg 768w, https://tripjive.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Nuwara-Eliya-strawberry-picking-season.jpg 1344w" sizes="(max-width: 696px) 100vw, 696px" /></noscript></p>
<h2>Popular Strawberry Farms to Visit</h2>
<p>Nuwara Eliya is known for its top strawberry farms. <b>Jagro Strawberries</b> and <b>Ramya Horticulture (Pvt) Ltd</b> are the best. Each farm offers a special experience for picking strawberries.</p>
<h3>Jagro Strawberries</h3>
<p><b>Jagro Strawberries</b> is near Nanu Oya and grows strawberries in the sun. They grow strawberries fast, ready in 3 to 5 months. Visitors can pick their own strawberries, making it a fun outing.</p>
<p>The fields are lively, and the strawberries are delicious. It&#8217;s a great place for families and friends to enjoy together.</p>
<h3>Ramya Horticulture (Pvt) Ltd</h3>
<p><b>Ramya Horticulture (Pvt) Ltd</b> is on the Ambewela &#8211; Pattipola Road. It&#8217;s a big farm that lets you pick strawberries and see other crops. You can take a tractor tour to see different vegetables and strawberries.</p>
<p>This adds a learning experience to your visit. It helps you understand local farming better.</p>
